  "id": "chicken-and-brussels-sprouts-with-bacon-and-potatoes",
  "name": "Chicken and Brussels Sprouts with Bacon and Potatoes",
  "subtitle": "A savory one-pan chicken dinner with crisp vegetables and bacon",
  "description": "Chicken thighs roast with potatoes, Brussels sprouts, bacon, garlic, thyme, and ranch seasoning for a hearty four-serving meal.",
